    "details": {
      "alignment": "True Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Quartermaster Thornbury.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>thornbury</code>): Medium humanoid (human), True Neutral; CR 1 (proficiency +2, to hit +5 with DEX); AC 14 (concealed padded vest & agility), hit points 27 (6d8), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The Mages' Guild spy and expense auditor who charged Archie 2,062 gold pieces for a single broken rope. Caught taking a heated luxury bubble bath during operational hours, he was dragged away by the ear by Byscilla Danos.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> quartermaster spy · <strong>tier:</strong> Mages' Guild Auditor · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Manor Command.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/thornbury.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 610002, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A balding, stuffy middle-aged human clerk in round spectacles, a rumpled brown tweed vest, holding a wooden abacus and itemized parchment ledgers clutched tightly against his chest. Scowling and anxious expression. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
